		(descr "BZCN TSB001 side-actuated SMD tactile, 7.7x3.55mm, right-angle with bracket (LCSC C2888448 = TSB001A3518A, 3.5mm/180gf; land common to all TSB001 force/height variants). Pads 1/2 = brass contacts (the switched terminals: pad1 signal, pad2 GND); pads 3/4 = stainless mounting bracket (tie to GND). Two NPTH Ø0.9 locators. Actuator faces -Y. Closest LCSC match to the Same Sky TS32.")
